рим The coat looks good, а о нескольких — The coats look good.\n\nПосле like действуют знакомые правила артиклей: like a coat, like an old coat, но like my coat — перед my артикль не нужен.\n\nЧтобы спросить о внешнем впечатлении, используйте How does it look? — «Как это выглядит?» После does глагол look стоит без окончания -s.","highlights":["look / looks + прилагательное","The sweater looks warm","look / looks like + существительное или сочетание с ним","This coat looks like my old coat","like","It looks good.","It looks like my coat.","I / you / we / they → look","he / she / it → looks","The coat looks good","The coats look good","like a coat","like an old coat","like my coat","my","How does it look?","does","look","-s"]}]},"exercises":[{"version":1,"id":"a12w4l1-words","kind":"matching","title":"Match the pictures with the words.","layout":"picture-word","items":[{"id":"picture-coat","text":"Picture 1","assetId":"A1M4L1_IMAGE_01","alt":"A coat","image":"assets/lesson-media/a1-2/module-4/lesson-1/images/coat-cutout.webp","imageWidth":1122,"imageHeight":1402,"correctId":"coat"},{"id":"picture-sweater","text":"Picture 2","assetId":"A1M4L1_IMAGE_02","alt":"A sweater","image":"assets/lesson-media/a1-2/module-4/lesson-1/images/sweater-cutout.webp","imageWidth":1254,"imageHeight":1254,"correctId":"sweater"},{"id":"picture-blouse","text":"Picture 3","assetId":"A1M4L1_IMAGE_03","alt":"A blouse","image":"assets/lesson-media/a1-2/module-4/lesson-1/images/blouse-cutout.webp","imageWidth":1254,"imageHeight":1254,"correctId":"blouse"},{"id":"picture-skirt","text":"Picture 4","assetId":"A1M4L1_IMAGE_04","alt":"A skirt","image":"assets/lesson-media/a1-2/module-4/lesson-1/images/skirt-cutout.webp","imageWidth":1122,"imageHeight":1402,"correctId":"skirt"},{"id":"picture-suit","text":"Picture 5","assetId":"A1M4L1_IMAGE_05","alt":"A suit","image":"assets/lesson-media/a1-2/module-4/lesson-1/images/suit-cutout.webp","imageWidth":1254,"imageHeight":1254,"correctId":"suit"},{"id":"pict